THE TRAP CONFIRMED ABSENT vs. THE TWO REAL GAPS:
1. Success announcement (line 2732, `renameStatus = m.roster_section_renamed({ name });`) has NO generation check at all before it — this is the ungated cross-collective announcement the issue names, and it is the single most important finding: a rename settling after a switch away will announce into the new collective's live region.
2. The `finally` block's `renamePending = false;` (line 2753) is UNCONDITIONAL — not gated by `if (g === routeLoad.generation)` — matching the #296/#287-established defect shape ("clearing finally blocks are not generation-guarded").

